# promise: #695
# A right-click on a pinned extension in the toolbar shows Arc's menu for it (Chromium's extension
# action menu, as Arc 1.17x shows it): its name, Options for an extension with an options page,
# Unpin, Manage Extension and View Web Permissions, with Cra's icon choices under Icon. Until 0.1.54 it
# showed only the icon choices. Manage Extension opens Chrome's page for the one extension; Options
# its options page; Unpin takes the button off the bar. The extension's own action items, the site
# access line and Remove are the engine's menu model and not here yet.
budget rss=700 stalls50=10
seed settings.json {"hasSeenImportPrompt": true, "toolbarDefaultMigrated": true, "showToolbar": true}
cra://debug?installExtension=${FIXTURES}/Extension
relaunch
cra://open?url=${PAGE}?n=menu
wait 3
cra://debug?pinExtension=${EXTENSION_ID}
wait 2
cra://debug?extensionMenu=${EXTENSION_ID}&label=rows
expect-log extension menu rows: Cra Scenario Fixture \(off\) \| - \| Options \| Unpin \| - \| Manage Extension \| View Web Permissions \| - \| Icon ▸$
cra://debug?extensionMenu=${EXTENSION_ID}&label=manage&press=Manage%20Extension
wait 2
cra://debug?extensionMenu=${EXTENSION_ID}&label=after-manage
expect-log extension tab after-manage: manage$
cra://debug?extensionMenu=${EXTENSION_ID}&label=options&press=Options
wait 2
cra://debug?extensionMenu=${EXTENSION_ID}&label=after-options
expect-log extension tab after-options: options$
cra://debug?extensionMenu=${EXTENSION_ID}&label=permissions&press=View%20Web%20Permissions
wait 2
cra://debug?extensionMenu=${EXTENSION_ID}&label=after-permissions
expect-log extension tab after-permissions: webPermissions$
cra://debug?extensionMenu=${EXTENSION_ID}&label=unpin&press=Unpin
expect-log extension pinned unpin: 0$
wait 1
cra://debug?extensionMenu=${EXTENSION_ID}&label=gone
expect-log extension menu gone: no menu$
reject-log fault:
